{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:trailingItems:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"  View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Appearances","text":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Technical constraints","anchor":"Technical-constraints","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Platform-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Badges-uses","text":"Badges uses"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used."}]},{"anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code sample"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top","isActive":true}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","text":"Liquid Glass","level":3,"anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":4,"anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","level":4,"text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}],"type":"